        </div>
        <div>
          <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-137393-137411"><rb>洞</rb><rt>くきの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-137411-137422">海辺の</seg></p>
          <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><seg source="#source-137422-137442">船もよい</seg></p>
          <p><seg source="#source-137442-137465">船も帆がなきや</seg></p>
