          <p><seg source="#source-137499-137519">お供についた</seg></p>
          <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><seg source="#source-137519-137542">クマワニが</seg></p>
          <p><seg source="#source-137542-137556">山で帆柱</seg></p>
          <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><seg source="#source-137556-137581">伐りました</seg></p>
          <p><seg source="#source-137581-137601">その時伐つた</seg></p>
          <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><seg source="#source-137601-137618">帆柱は</seg></p>
          <p><seg source="#source-137618-137632">帆柱山の</seg></p>
          <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><seg source="#source-137632-137657">杉でした。</seg></p>
