          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p><seg source="#source-138995-139022">帆かけた　お船は　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-139022-139040"><rb>何処</rb><rt>どこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-139040-139051">へゆく</seg></p>
          <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-139051-139075"><rb>大浪</rb><rt>おおなみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-139075-139107">　小浪に　ゆれながら</seg></p>
          <p><seg source="#source-139107-139147">遠くの　遠くの　海へゆく</seg></p>
          <p><seg source="#source-139147-139159">海には　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-139159-139180"><rb>珊瑚</rb><rt>さんご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-139180-139197">の　離れ島</seg></p>
          <p><seg source="#source-139197-139232">空には　七つの　離れ星</seg></p>
          <p><seg source="#source-139232-139272">お星も　珊瑚の　磯に出る</seg></p>
          <p><seg source="#source-139272-139313">お星の　出るころ　聞ゆるは</seg></p>
          <p><seg source="#source-139313-139348">眠れや　眠れの　子守唄</seg></p>
          <p><seg source="#source-139348-139393">お舟も　その唄　聞いて来る</seg></p>
        </div>
        <div type="layout" source="#source-139393-139478" style="padding-inline-start: 1em">
          <div>
