          <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-139591-139610">大漁だね</seg></p>
          <p><seg source="#source-139610-139630">渚に　お金が</seg></p>
          <p><seg source="#source-139630-139649">降つて来る</seg></p>
          <p><seg source="#source-139649-139675">と、言うて浜辺は</seg></p>
          <p><seg source="#source-139675-139691">寝ずの番</seg></p>
