          <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-139720-139739">大漁だネ</seg></p>
          <p><seg source="#source-139739-139765">さうとも　今年は</seg></p>
          <p><seg source="#source-139765-139781">大漁だヨ</seg></p>
          <p><seg source="#source-139781-139801">積まれた魚が</seg></p>
          <p><seg source="#source-139801-139817">山となる</seg></p>
          <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-139817-139846">オヤオヤ　浜辺は</seg></p>
          <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-139849-139876"><rb>繁昌</rb><rt>はんじよう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-139876-139888">だネ</seg></p>
        </div>
        <div type="layout" source="#source-139888-139967" style="padding-inline-start: 1em">
          <div>
            <head n="2" source="#source-139909-139963"><seg source="#source-139909-139921">青い小窓</seg></head>
