          <p><seg source="#source-140653-140676">朝から　晩まで</seg></p>
          <p><seg source="#source-140676-140704">モウモウヒヒンと</seg></p>
          <p><seg source="#source-140704-140727">仔牛もよろこべ</seg></p>
          <p><seg source="#source-140727-140750">仔馬もよろこべ</seg></p>
