          <p><seg source="#source-140775-140798">朝から　晩まで</seg></p>
          <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-140798-140829">ニコニコヤンヤと</seg></p>
          <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-140829-140850"><rb>成人</rb><rt>おとな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-140850-140867">もよろこぶ</seg></p>
          <p><seg source="#source-140867-140890">子供もよろこぶ</seg></p>
          <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-140890-140902">田舎は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-140902-140926"><rb>放楽</rb><rt>はうらく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-140926-140935">ヨ</seg></p>
