            <head n="3" source="#source-185909-185981"><seg source="#source-185909-185915">一　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-185915-185930"><rb>凧</rb><rt>タコ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-185930-185936">アゲ</seg></head>
